{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05374","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 萧嵩","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝曰简才能，旌贤在股肱。\n文章体一变，礼乐道逾弘。\n芸阁英华入，宾门鵷鹭登。\n恩筵过所望，圣泽实超恒。\n夏叶开红药，余花发紫藤。\n微臣亦何幸，叨此预文朋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧嵩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}